    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9140" root="حمق" body-key="H">
    
      7 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انحمق</span></b> : see 1. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also <i>He acted in the
manner of the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَمْقَى</span> [i. e. <i>foolish,</i> or <i>stupid,</i> &amp;c.];
(K;) and so ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استحمق</span></b> . (Lth, T, Mgh, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3- 
<i>He</i> (a man, TA) <i>was,</i> or <i>became, abject, humble,</i>
or <i>submissive,</i> (K, TA,) <i>and impotent to do,</i> or
<i>accomplish, a thing.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  (tropical:)  <i>It</i> (a garment)
<i>became old, and worn out.</i> (S, Mgh, K, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b5- 

(assumed tropical:)  <i>It</i> (food, or wheat,) <i>became cheap.</i> (Az, TA.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b6-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انحمقت السُّوقُ</span>: see 1.

